{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PAGER</strong> is a 1-bit 3D Kafkaesque experience in a 90s office building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obey the pager to survive and climb the corporate ladder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/8607be843237aa838829097727cfe9c0.webp?t=1771233161\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/8607be843237aa838829097727cfe9c0.poster.avif?t=1771233161\" class=\"bb_img\" width=516 height=288 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-bit 3D graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60  weird and beautiful  floors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has some horror and humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is conveyed in a very indirect way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The levels aren't about the destination.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It shouldn't give you any satisfaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caffeine-addicted butterflies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/1e44c0504fcadf8897c2bae32b9f0c2f.webp?t=1771233161\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/1e44c0504fcadf8897c2bae32b9f0c2f.poster.avif?t=1771233161\" class=\"bb_img\" width=516 height=288 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by </strong>Severance, Franz Kafka, David Lynch, The Prisoner (1967), The Stanley Parable,\u00a0Sonny Boy,\u00a0Serial Experiments Lain</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/f896b3db6d62e0643050246538182b60.webp?t=1771233161\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/f896b3db6d62e0643050246538182b60.poster.avif?t=1771233161\" class=\"bb_img\" width=516 height=288 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope you find it interesting! Thank you for playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/0a5489c36f52eefde25abc413dd33d98.webp?t=1771233161\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2810550/extras/0a5489c36f52eefde25abc413dd33d98.poster.avif?t=1771233161\" class=\"bb_img\" width=516 height=288 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Prize [1]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2810550/ff4b2dd1ba72c1f64e4c09da2cf2635d86f16950.jpg"},{"name":"Prize [2]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2810550/710b1f3159d36560b9e1480ea85d17a9feaca19b.jpg"},{"name":"Prize [3]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2810550/c0f7711c273ecd891783102be4dd2f07c56cdf45.jpg"},{"name":"Prize [4]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2810550/39089685ba166f4be402a27f39afa437d550b8ef.jpg"},{"name":"Prize [5]","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2810550/fb4df3be826300cfec8f603d58883286d1174142.jpg"},{"name":"Prize [6]","path":"https